n class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221213185404&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mother_Of_Jack_b7cb62.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Mother Of Jack.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>JAAAAACK? EVERYTHING ALRIGHT DOWN THERE?</li><li>Oh dear, I can't find anything in here!</li><li>There is still some dust on the drawer over there. What where you thinking, Jane?</li><li>Jane!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>North-western <a href=\"#/wiki/Stonehome\">Stonehome</a>, one floor up\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>She lives with her son <a href=\"#/wiki/Jack\">Jack</a> and her daughter <a href=\"#/wiki/Sister%20Of%20Jack\">Jane</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Stonehome\">Stonehome</a> and takes care of them.<br/>\nPart of the <a href=\"#/quest/jack-to-the-future-quest\">Jack to the Future Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Mother Of Jack.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hi<br/>\nMother Of Jack: I demand an explanation of you entering our house without any invitation.<br/>\nPlayer: name<br/>\nMother Of Jack: I'm the mother of Jack and Jane.<br/>\nPlayer: job<br/>\nMother Of Jack: I do the cooking and some other housework. Jack's sister Jane is helping me a lot, though.<br/>\nPlayer: Edron<br/>\nMother Of Jack: I have lived here as long as I can remember. And the same goes for Jack and his sister Jane.<br/>\nPlayer: time<br/>\nMother Of Jack: It's exactly 4:26 pm.<br/>\nPlayer: Thais<br/>\nMother Of Jack: I don't even know where that is.<br/>\nPlayer: Tibia<br/>\nMother Of Jack: I'm happy right here as long as Jack and Jane are with me.<br/>\nPlayer: king / Tibianus<br/>\nMother Of Jack: Now you start asking the same things like Jack's sister, what's all the fuss about visiting the king anyway.<br/>\nPlayer: army<br/>\nMother Of Jack: I would never allow Jack to go away from here, he stays with us.<br/>\nPlayer: excalibug<br/>\nMother Of Jack: I'm afraid I don't understand.<br/>\nPlayer: news / rumors<br/>\nMother Of Jack: I'm sorry but I do not have any news for you.<br/>\nPlayer: Jane / sister<br/>\nMother Of Jack: Well, <b>Jane</b> is of course helping me with the household, always doing this and that. Hardworking girl she is, hardworking girl.<br/>\nPlayer: Jack<br/>\nMother Of Jack: You can find him downstairs - just in case you missed him when you first invaded our private sphere.<br/>\nPlayer: bye<br/>\nMother Of Jack: Farewell.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Mother Of Jack</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["jack-to-the-future-quest"],"pos":{"x":33274,"y":31756,"z":6}}